  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Roughly chop capsicum into bite-sized chunks.\n• Thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Grate zucchini.\n• Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water. Add fusilli and a pinch of salt. Cook over high heat until ‘al dente’, 11 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/2 cup for 2P / 1 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03765dd28c6dab323668/step-650e3500.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook carrot and capsicum until tender, 4-5 mins. Add zucchini and cook until tender, 2-3 mins.\n• Reduce heat to medium, add Nan’s special seasoning and garlic & herb spice blend, then cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in light cooking cream, reserved pasta water and the butter and cook, until bubbling, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03765dd28c6dab323668/step-3e921810.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high.\n• Remove pan from heat and stir through cooked fusilli, until combined. Season with pepper.\n• Transfer pasta mixture to a baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03765dd28c6dab323668/step-262a3a20.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide cheesy veggie pasta bake between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with the chilli flakes (if using) to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/698d03765dd28c6dab323668/step-6bc0f930.jpeg"
    }
  ]
